  "owned_units": [
    {
      "excerpt": "痊愈：指不良事件消失。无论参与者的基线情况是否异常，当不良事件恢复至基线时，即为痊愈。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1150"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30130,
      "source_ref": "body.p1150",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1150"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-6514c434b7d574e83f69219c",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "好转/缓解：指不良事件减轻或缓解，在报告时还未消失。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1151"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30140,
      "source_ref": "body.p1151",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1151"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-6fa336f8c64c45509f9c108f",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "未好转/未缓解/持续：指不良事件在报告时仍未减轻或缓解。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1152"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30150,
      "source_ref": "body.p1152",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1152"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-89c01672102f771c1f8a3d0a",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "伴后遗症：指不良事件导致长期的或永久的生理机能障碍。不应将恢复期或恢复阶段的某些症状视为后遗症。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1153"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30160,
      "source_ref": "body.p1153",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1153"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-1bfbb68fd2fe7829275b7c80",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "致死：指参与者因该不良事件导致死亡。如果参与者同时报告有多个不良事件，其中仅一个不良事件导致死亡，其它未导致死亡的不良事件的结果不应选择死亡。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1154"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30170,
      "source_ref": "body.p1154",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1154"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-3d7ea99fd5234e40513482b7",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "不良事件的结束时间",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1155"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30180,
      "source_ref": "body.p1155",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1155"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-f69f9102268a40b8fda1b341",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "应以不良事件解决（如痊愈、致死）、恢复到基线时状态或状态稳定并不能恢复得更好作为不良事件的结束时间。时间应尽量精确到年月日，如信息收集不全，也应具体到年月。若参与者失访或撤回知情同意，此情况不应作为“因AE导致退出”而记录；若明确因AE而退出，则必须跟踪随访具体的退出时间。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1156"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30190,
      "source_ref": "body.p1156",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1156"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-8d4e3c940b0b2546fb805ea9",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "如参与者死亡时未收集到结束时间，非导致“死亡”直接原因的不良事件仍然持续，则该不良事件的结束时间应空缺，状态为“持续”。如判断为导致“死亡”的直接或主要原因的不良事件，结束时间为参与者死亡时间。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "不良事件的随访"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1157"
      ],
